Refer to the Cheques table. Which cheques does this query return?

SELECT chq_no FROM Cheques
WHERE amount > ALL (SELECT amount FROM Cheques WHERE status = 'Returned');

Refer to the Cheques table. What value does this query show in the diff column for cheque C108?

SELECT chq_no, amount - LAG(amount) OVER (PARTITION BY acc_no ORDER BY presented_on, chq_no) AS diff
FROM Cheques;
